"""Complete, individually written scenes for distinctive indoor locations."""

SPECIAL = {}
def special(filename, vnum, description, *places):
    SPECIAL[f'{filename}:{vnum}'] = (description, places)

def mist(vnum, description, *places):
    special('mists.are', vnum, description, *places)

mist(41003, "Painted studies climb the studio wall in an untidy ladder of color. A broad `wworktable`x stands beneath them, the nearest edge crusted with little ridges left by a palette knife. A jar-shaped stain has dried into a blue halo on the wood. The room smells of paper and worked paint, a close, companionable space made larger by the pictures filling it.", 'worktable')
mist(41007, "Frost has silvered the grain of the Northgard tavern's `wbar`x. Thick legs hold the `wtables`x above a floor darkened by older thaw marks, and the wall carvings wear white edges where cold has found the deepest cuts. The room has a stubborn, sheltering weight: heavy timber, broad furniture, and a bitter chill that makes the promise of company feel unusually precious.", 'bar', 'tables')
mist(41009, "Iridescent red mineral skins coat the tunnel in overlapping scales. The nearest walls are close enough for the colors to break into wine-dark folds and thin coppery edges; farther away, the same surfaces merge into a bruised glow. Low ridges interrupt the gritty floor. The passage feels grown around a wound, intricate at arm's length and difficult to hold together as a whole.")
mist(41010, "Club Catacombs fits theatrical upholstery beneath the uncompromising weight of old masonry. A low `wsofa`x occupies an arched recess, the fabric richly textured beside stone that has never acquired a comfortable edge. The open floor carries a web of heel marks. Perfume lingers close to the cushions, unable to disguise the cellar's cool mineral smell.", 'sofa')
mist(41012, "The royal `wbed`x rises on carved feet beneath a canopy lined in dull gold. Candle cups stand in carefully balanced groups around the chamber, their accumulated wax giving the formal arrangement a softer, less obedient outline. A faded hunting scene crosses the fabric behind the pillows. The room offers grandeur at a human distance, with the private creases of bedding beneath the ceremonial display.", 'bed')
mist(41015, "La Tasse Cassee has made an art of the cup that almost matches. Mismatched china gathers above the service fittings, while a `wcorner table`x sits beneath a print whose frame is more elaborate than the picture. Old coffee rings survive beside wine-colored stains in the tabletop. It's an intimate, disreputable sort of warmth, inviting a story to become more interesting with each leisurely retelling.", 'corner table')
mist(41016, "No opening interrupts the chamber's walls. Pale, seamless surfaces curve into one another, denying the eye even the comfort of a definite corner. A small, darker oval marks the otherwise blank floor, looking less like a stain than a place the surrounding color has withdrawn from. The enclosure has no obvious center, yet every attempt to look away from the oval seems to return there.")
mist(41025, "A row of unfinished portraits faces the painting studio's `wworktable`x. Their backgrounds are complete, but several faces remain pale shapes inside carefully rendered collars. Thin strips of color test the edges of the nearest working board. The room smells of dry paper and old varnish, with the uneasy intimacy of a gathering whose guests have not quite become people.", 'worktable')
mist(41029, "The abandoned well drops within a collar of rough masonry. The `wstone rim`x has been smoothed by hands and weather, but the inner blocks keep sharp, uneven edges beneath a dark mineral skin. A broken length of old fitting rests against the outer wall. The cool air rising from below carries the smell of wet stone and a depth the visible opening cannot adequately explain.", 'stone rim')
mist(41032, "Curved, silver-colored walls enclose a space with the unlikely proportions of an opened tin. Close parallel ridges run around the enclosure, while pale, fibrous layers form the ground beneath them. The upper edge has the sharp, unfinished outline of peeled metal. It's an absurdly domestic dream enlarged to walking size, carrying a faint briny smell and no convincing place for ordinary furniture.")
mist(41034, "The hidden tunnels beneath the Rue de Belleville have been patched with masonry from several different jobs. Pale brick interrupts older stone, and one broad repair has swallowed the lower half of a faded wall mark. A shallow drainage line follows the floor before bending out of the immediate view. The city feels present above as pressure and distance, reduced here to damp joints and enclosed air.")
mist(41035, "The pit narrows between walls that show different layers of disturbed ground. Coarse rubble forms a broken skirt below firmer material, with pale fragments trapped in darker earth. One projecting stone has been rubbed smooth along the upper face, although the surrounding edges remain sharp. The confined depth makes the skyward opening feel less like an exit than a measure of how much lies overhead.")
mist(41036, "Industrial edges and carefully chosen dining details meet at Bestia. A `wcorner table`x rests against rougher material than the smoothly finished tabletop, with the contrast repeated in dark fittings and softer cloth. A restrained framed image interrupts the longest stretch of wall. The room has a deliberate, urban warmth, giving an unhurried meal somewhere to settle inside the harder shell of the building.", 'corner table')
mist(41037, "The apartment's `wsofa`x has been angled to make a small room feel less square. A low shelf follows the wall behind it, interrupted by a framed print and a single pale ceramic shape. The rug is slightly too narrow for the furniture, exposing a strip of floor along one side. Nothing quite matches, but the differences have the easy familiarity of choices made to live with.", 'sofa')
mist(41039, "The Bibliotheque of Alexandria stacks the written world into close, uneven ranks. Tall shelves press around a broad `wreading table`x, their bindings running from brittle-looking cloth to dark leather worn smooth at the spine. Small labels have been fitted wherever space allowed, rather than in a single tidy line. The dry paper smell is deep enough to make the room seem older than the masonry enclosing it.", 'reading table')
mist(41040, "The bridge presents a hard, weathered crossing above the surrounding reach. Stone at the exposed edge has rounded more heavily than the inner paving, leaving shallow hollows where finer grit collects. The near parapet has a single darker block among the pale work. The span offers the stark practicality of a crossing, with open air keeping the structure from ever feeling like a room.")
mist(41045, "Mama's Pancakes Diner gathers sturdy chairs around tables with softly rounded edges. A `wcorner table`x sits beneath a cheerful print of a breakfast scene, the colors a little sweeter than anything in the practical furniture. A pale ring marks the tabletop where a warm dish once sat. The room holds a faint trace of coffee and syrup, the comfortable afterlife of an ordinary meal.", 'corner table')
mist(41046, "A strip of checked trim gives this version of Mama's Pancakes Diner a homemade cheerfulness. The `wcorner table`x rests beside a shallow display shelf, where mismatched crockery has been arranged with more affection than symmetry. The chair nearest the wall has a smoother back than the others. The room feels ready for company that knows the furniture well enough to have a favorite seat.", 'corner table')
mist(41048, "Broad color studies lean against the painting studio's lower walls, leaving the upper surfaces almost bare. The `wworktable`x carries a fan of fine scratches around a darker, oval working patch. A narrow cloth hangs from one edge, stiff with several generations of dried pigment. The studio has the practical warmth of a place where making something matters more than keeping the surroundings presentable.", 'worktable')
mist(41049, "The Crucible Club frames an open floor with dark, heat-colored finishes. Curving decorative lines suggest rising flame without quite forming a picture. A `wsofa`x is tucked beneath the lowest part of the surrounding trim, the upholstery catching a faint trace of perfume. The contrast between the broad floor and the close seating gives the Salem club a theatrical sense of something waiting to begin.", 'sofa')
mist(41052, "A compact `wsofa`x stands below a long, narrow picture in the small apartment. The frame is centered over the wall rather than the furniture, lending the whole arrangement a slight but persistent imbalance. A woven throw adds a warmer patch at one end. The room has the close, ordinary scale of a private refuge, with just enough space for company to become comfortable together.", 'sofa')
mist(41062, "Substantial shelving lends the Boston Athenaeum a quiet gravity. A `wreading table`x occupies the clear space between book-lined edges, the nearest surface inlaid with a fine, darker border. Small differences in the shelf fittings reveal several periods of careful addition. The room smells of dry bindings and restrained polish, offering the patient comfort of being surrounded by more reading than a visit could exhaust.", 'reading table')
mist(41070, "The entrance narrows around a broad, slightly uneven threshold. The surrounding finish changes just inside it, from a rougher outer surface to material worn smooth along the line of passing hands. A shallow recess catches a darker pocket beside the clearer middle. The place holds the small hesitation of an arrival, neither spacious enough to settle in nor quite part of what lies beyond.")
mist(41071, "The Baghdad museum warehouse arranges oversized storage bays around a clear working floor. A wooden packing support has been built to an unusual curve, suggesting the shape of something no longer resting in it. Small inventory labels repeat on the nearest compartments. Dry dust and old timber give the enclosure a patient smell, while the fitted supports preserve absences almost as carefully as objects.")
mist(41075, "The Nevada house has the perfect proportions of a remembered advertisement. A pale `wsofa`x faces a low table, and the edges of every domestic fitting soften slightly before they can be examined too closely. The walls seem sun-warmed without offering a reliable source for the warmth. It's a polished little dream of suburban ease, with something wavering just beyond the tidiest line.", 'sofa')
mist(41076, "The ground near Niflheimr has a hard, pale crust broken by darker seams. The nearest forms remain sharply outlined, but the farther landscape dissolves into layers that seem to belong to different distances. Frost-like patterns feather across the exposed material. The boundary of Northgard feels less like a line to cross than a gradual failure of familiar shapes to remain familiar.")
mist(41079, "Thick bands of wicker curve around the space in an immense, interlocking weave. Narrow gaps expose an uncertain brightness beyond, while the floor is covered in fabric whose checks have become broad squares. A loop of bound material rises along one side like the root of a handle. The enclosure has the warm, dry smell of a picnic basket remembered from somewhere much smaller.")
mist(41086, "The surroundings almost agree to become a place. A level surface gathers beneath the immediate view, then loosens toward edges that refuse to meet anything definite. A pale vertical shape might be a wall until attention rests on it. There's no convincing direction in which the uncertainty increases; nowhere seems equally near on every side.")
mist(41093, "Yellowed varnish covers boards broad enough to make a floor. Enormous letters arc across the grain, their dark edges softened by a network of fine cracks. A raised, pointer-shaped silhouette occupies the farther part of the dream, too still to suggest any answer. The space smells faintly of old wood, with the unsettling familiarity of a household object that has become a landscape.")
mist(41094, "The silver mine cuts a narrow working space through the mountain. Old supports have darkened where they meet the rock, and mineral threads pick out pale lines beyond the reach of ordinary handling. A low heap of chips has settled beneath a blunt tool scar. The air carries a cold, metallic dryness, with the abandoned workings retaining the shape of effort long after the workers have gone.")
mist(41095, "The mall looks familiar in a way that becomes less reassuring the longer it is examined. A `wcounter`x faces a broad retail floor, surrounded by display shapes that almost recall another visit. One decorative panel repeats where a different color seems expected. The polished public surfaces have the impersonal warmth of a place built to welcome everyone without remembering any of them.", 'counter')
mist(41101, "The ravine shelters a dense fold of green around the Oracle of Thrace. Broad leaves overlap with finer sprays, and the nearest rock carries pale mineral trails beneath the growth. A small clear patch has been kept among the roots without being furnished or fenced. The place feels secluded through the weight of the surrounding landscape, with the cultivated details nearly swallowed by the natural enclosure.")
mist(41103, "The Watchers' archive presses high shelves around a broad `wreading table`x. Narrow classification slips project from the nearest bindings at carefully varied heights, creating a second pattern beyond the books themselves. A long ruled panel offers more order than explanation. The room smells dry and papery, with the peculiar weight of a collection assembled to notice what ordinary histories might overlook.", 'reading table')
mist(41104, "La Femme en Rouge gathers deep red fabric into folds around a low `wsofa`x. The decorative trim is elaborate at a glance, then slightly uneven where the separate pieces meet. A small mirror returns a flattering fragment of the room rather than the whole arrangement. Perfume has settled into the upholstery, lending the Port-au-Prince bordello a warm, theatrical intimacy.", 'sofa')
mist(41108, "The discreet Edinburgh building presents a close face of weathered stone. The approach is plain, with the ground worn most smoothly just before the threshold and darker grit gathered against the wall. A shallow carving above the nearest joint is too restrained to command attention. The exterior keeps the purpose of the rooms inside to itself, offering little more than solid masonry and an unshowy entrance.")
mist(41109, "The small town gathers in modest built shapes around a patch of traveled ground. Repairs overlap along the nearest surfaces, their different shades lending Charming an unpolished, lived-in texture. A narrow decorative border has been carefully maintained beside more practical wear. The setting has the intimate scale of somewhere whose ordinary corners might become familiar before a visitor learns many names.")
mist(41110, "The strip club frames a broad performance floor with dark decorative panels and a low `wsofa`x. The upholstery holds perfume more readily than the harder room holds any sense of privacy. Fine heel marks cross the open surface in overlapping arcs. Even between performances, the arrangement is insistently theatrical, making the distinction between watching and being watched difficult to forget.", 'sofa')
mist(41112, "The Institute's interior is severe in small, consistent ways. Panel edges meet at precise heights, and the floor pattern continues beneath the fittings without a casual interruption. A narrow notice surface has been cleared almost completely, leaving one pale rectangle where paper recently rested. The room offers institutional order without much welcome, making a small misplaced object seem capable of becoming an event.")
mist(41114, "Broken masonry gathers into low, incomplete forms in the ruins of Babylon. A shallow band of decoration survives on one protected face, the pattern abruptly interrupted where the next section has fallen away. Fine dust fills the smaller cuts. The place is more legible in fragments than as a whole, with the remaining surfaces suggesting arrangements too large for the immediate view to restore.")
mist(41115, "Retail shelving divides Bed, Bath, and Beyond into carefully presented domestic possibilities. Folded fabric makes neat blocks of color beside displays of household fittings, with a `wcounter`x marking the customer edge. One demonstration setting looks almost inhabited until the spacing gives away the display. The store has the dry, packaged smell of things waiting to become part of somebody's ordinary life.", 'counter')
mist(41119, "A curved, crumb-textured surface rises around the space, pale gold beneath scattered dark-blue hollows. Fine cracks branch through the nearer material, while a yellowish edge suggests zest at a scale that makes little sense. The air carries a remembered sweetness rather than a convincing bakery smell. It's the interior logic of a scone made briefly large enough to wander through.")
mist(41122, "Carved posts surround the royal `wbed`x, their upper leaves picked out against a canopy of heavy cloth. Candle fittings line the nearer wall, each one holding a different accumulation of cooled wax. A narrow embroidered border repeats along the bedding, more restrained than the room around it. The chamber feels ceremonious at first glance and unexpectedly personal at the scale of a pillow or a folded sheet.", 'bed')
mist(41125, "The London flat makes careful use of a modest floor. A compact `wsofa`x faces a shallow book shelf, with a narrow rug leaving the outer edges of the room plainly visible. A small framed print is hung low enough to meet a seated glance. The furnishings have the quiet confidence of things chosen to fit, giving the tidy enclosure a comfortable life beyond mere neatness.", 'sofa')
mist(41127, "A broad partition divides this Baghdad museum warehouse into unequal storage bays. The nearest racks hold fitted supports rather than a uniform run of shelves, each one shaped around a different sort of object. Paper labels sit beneath the heavier joints. A chalky dust has found the sheltered corners, giving the room the stillness of a collection resting between more public appearances.")
mist(41129, "The Wynn smoking lounge puts a generous `wsofa`x beneath a restrained sweep of polished trim. The fabric is dark enough to make the small reflective details seem brighter, while a low table holds the center of the seating arrangement. An old tobacco trace lingers beneath the cleaner furniture finish. The room offers an expensive sort of ease, with every comfortable distance looking carefully considered.", 'sofa')
mist(41130, "The museum warehouse in Baghdad opens around a low, reinforced handling platform. An unusually tall storage frame dominates one side, the empty spaces between the supports as conspicuous as the timber itself. Small patches of protective padding remain fixed at different heights. The enclosure feels practical and watchful, built to hold things whose most awkward shapes have already been anticipated.")
mist(41131, "The set of Revenge: Best Served Cold! is convincing until the eye follows a wall too far. A finished surface ends beside the rough back of a scenic panel, and an apparently solid fitting reveals a lighter supporting frame from the side. The floor carries quiet marks for positions and alignment. The place holds two realities at once: the room being presented and the workshop making the presentation possible.")
mist(41132, "Pale curves gather around the divine sanctum without settling into ordinary architecture. Each border seems complete until the next one suggests a larger pattern continuing beyond it. A small central motif repeats in finer forms along the enclosing surfaces. The space has a beautiful, difficult composure, as though every detail belongs exactly where it is while the whole remains beyond a comfortable explanation.")
mist(41133, "Gaming furniture occupies an abandoned warehouse shell with an air of deliberate understatement. A `wcard table`x sits beneath exposed structural work, the softer playing surface sharply different from the scarred industrial floor. The surrounding fittings are practical rather than grand. The room feels arranged for people who prefer the business in front of them to draw less attention than the building around it.", 'card table')
mist(41135, "A broad `wdesk`x gives the basement office a polish the abandoned warehouse above has not earned. Refined trim meets a heavier lower wall, and a carefully chosen chair faces the working surface across a measured gap. A framed print conceals part of an older repair. The room's swanky presentation feels intentional down to the last edge, a private claim staked inside the rougher building.", 'desk')
mist(41141, "Yirazi Estate presents a composed domestic interior built from substantial surfaces and quiet detail. A `wsofa`x rests beneath a long decorative panel, with smaller ornaments arranged in uneven groups rather than strict pairs. Fine wood grain warms the more formal edges. The room has the settled assurance of a house meant to be occupied over time, with room for personal habits to gather around the careful finish.", 'sofa')
mist(41144, "The tumulus encloses Arsinoe's memorial space beneath a heavy mass of earth and stone. Closely fitted masonry gives way to a rougher upper curve, with pale deposits tracing the deepest joints. The visible floor has been kept spare before the more deliberate stonework. The room's solemnity comes from weight and proportion, the sense of a small human purpose protected beneath something much larger.")
mist(41146, "The Larchmont home gathers a generous `wsofa`x beneath restrained, carefully finished woodwork. A broad rug keeps the seated arrangement distinct from the clearer outer floor, and a small framed landscape occupies an unexpectedly intimate position beside the furniture. The room is lavish through space and material rather than a crowd of ornament, leaving company room to become comfortable without diminishing the presentation.", 'sofa')
mist(41148, "Natural passages beneath Mount Kore fold through stone with a fine, layered grain. One low ridge rises from the floor before merging into the wall, making the boundary between the two difficult to place. Loose chips have collected in a protected hollow. The cave has a cool mineral smell, and the irregular enclosure returns sound in pieces rather than a single dependable echo.")
mist(41155, "The trench drops into a depth the nearer water can only suggest. Suspended particles obscure the smaller contours, while a broad, sloping shape remains visible long enough to make the distance behind it seem greater. Darker water gathers beyond the last readable edge. There is no room-like enclosure here, only the immense, submerged separation between a recognizable surface and whatever lies farther below.")
mist(41168, "A broad `wbed`x stands beneath a paneled headboard, balanced by a softer rug that reaches beyond the foot. The bedding uses two closely related colors, giving the room depth without a sharp contrast. A small framed print sits above a plain bedside surface. The bedroom is well appointed through proportion and texture, offering a quiet place to rest without filling every spare edge with furniture.", 'bed')
mist(41176, "A narrow `wtreatment table`x occupies the surgery room's most carefully cleared space. Washable surfaces surround it, but the older construction shows through in crooked joints and a stain beneath one fixed fitting. The contrast makes the clinical order feel purposeful rather than reassuring. A sharp cleaning smell hangs over the room, failing to lend any warmth to the spare arrangement.", 'treatment table')
mist(41177, "The hallway runs beside a sequence of individual holding cells. Repeated frames break the wall into narrow intervals, their lower edges marked by a different wear than the clearer passage. A broad patch of floor has been replaced without quite matching the surrounding finish. The corridor makes the cells feel both separate and relentlessly similar, a measured route past a succession of confined spaces.")
mist(41178, "The dockside receiving space is organized around a broad working floor and reinforced lower walls. Old handling marks run toward a stout protective rail, where the metal has been rubbed brighter by bulky loads. The nearer structure holds a faint salt-like crust in the sheltered joints. The room has the practical scale of goods passing through, with no furniture added simply to occupy the margins.")
mist(41179, "The luxurious suite reveals three domestic scales within one composed interior: a formal arrival edge, a softer seated arrangement, and a quieter sleeping position. A `wsofa`x gathers the middle beneath restrained decorative panels, while a `wbed`x rests beyond the more public furniture. Closely related colors carry between them. The finish makes the whole feel connected without asking every part of a visit to happen in the same place.", 'sofa', 'bed')
mist(41187, "The passage within Mount Damavan holds a pale seam high in the rock, visible as a crooked line above darker material. Loose fragments collect below a rough projection, grading from blunt pieces to fine grit. The ground narrows beside the enclosing mass. The mountain is present as texture and pressure, with the cool, sheltered air carrying little suggestion of the open landscape beyond.")
mist(41194, "The psych ward uses pale finishes and deliberately simple fittings to keep the public interior easy to read. `wWaiting chairs`x sit beside a low divider, their practical spacing allowing company without crowding the clearer floor. A restrained print interrupts the longest blank wall. The room offers order rather than intimacy, with a faint medicinal smell and very few details left to chance.", 'waiting chairs')
mist(41206, "The esoteric shop crowds narrow displays around a modest `wcounter`x. Boxes and small presentation stands vary in shape, with labels that become more careful as the objects become harder to classify. A dark backing makes the pale edges of the nearest display conspicuous. The room smells of paper, packaging, and something dryly aromatic, giving curiosity a comfortable place within the cramped arrangement.", 'counter')
mist(41212, "Austin Prepatory's interior has the durable finish of an institution accustomed to young people moving through it. A narrow display panel presents work in evenly spaced rectangles, while the lower wall carries more practical reinforcement. The floor is clearer through the middle than along the margins. The place combines modest aspiration with the ordinary small knocks of a building used for education.")
mist(41213, "Dark, glossy planes divide the space into broad sections, their edges pale where the chocolate-like surface seems to have broken. A berry-colored core shows through one rounded hollow, startling against the deeper brown. The surrounding scale remains softly uncertain. It's a dream of sweetness made architectural, too coherent to dismiss at a glance and too unlikely to accept for long.")
mist(41214, "The underground discotheque presses dark finishes beneath a low, substantial ceiling. A `wsofa`x sits in the quieter margin, the upholstery holding a stale smoke trace beneath the sharper suggestion of perfume. The broad dance surface is crossed by countless fine turns and heel marks. The room feels close and theatrical, making company at the edge seem intimate beside the exposed middle.", 'sofa')
mist(41215, "Pillars divide the circular room into measured intervals beneath surrounding balconies. Their bases have a heavier finish than the shafts above, giving the lower space a grounded weight despite the repeated curves. A narrow decorative band follows the enclosure without quite meeting evenly at the final join. The room offers many angles on the same center, making a small movement rearrange the whole apparent composition.")
mist(41218, "Pale, looping forms cross a broad, curved basin at an impossible scale. The enclosing surface has the soft reflection of broth, while darker shapes remain suspended beyond a convincing reach. The room carries the idea of warmth more strongly than any ordinary kitchen smell. Familiar food has become unfamiliar geography, with no sensible boundary between the bowl and the space being occupied.")
mist(41220, "The warehouse refuses the simple proportions expected of an industrial room. A heavy support stands slightly away from the line of the others, and a shallow recess narrows into an angle that seems to serve no practical load. Repairs use different materials without disguising the joins. The dilapidation makes the strange arrangement harder to explain: damage has altered the surfaces, but the oddness seems built into the plan.")
mist(41226, "The animal resources center keeps the working surfaces plain and readily washable. A `wconsultation table`x occupies a clear position beside the more closely fitted stations, giving discussion a separate scale from the practical work. Small labels and measured compartments repeat along the storage. The room has a controlled research character, with a sharp cleaning trace and little decorative material to complicate the finish.", 'consultation table')
mist(41232, "Mount Ida's nearer rock shows a broad, sloping face divided by pale mineral threads. Small fragments have gathered beneath the deepest fracture, their fresh edges distinct from the weathered mass above. The immediate ground is uneven and spare. The mountain offers an exposed scale through the shape of the stone, with a stark openness around the exposed ground.")
mist(41238, "The countryside villa at Anupharis gathers pale wall surfaces around a low `wsofa`x and a simply finished table. A narrow decorative border has been worked by hand, the pattern varying slightly where it turns each corner. Coarser fabric softens the seated position. The room has an unhurried domestic warmth, with the fine details kept close enough to notice while sharing the furniture.", 'sofa')
mist(41239, "The Portalstone stands within a close arrangement of worn surfaces, a single more deliberate shape among them. Shallow lines cross the stone and continue around the edges without revealing a complete pattern from one angle. The surrounding floor remains spare. The place draws attention through the contrast between the marked slab and the ordinary material around it, the carved lines seeming sharper each time the eye returns to them.")
mist(41241, "The camp is held together by rough supports and fabric that remembers several earlier folds. A patched section crosses one side at an angle, the newer weave a shade tighter than the surrounding shelter. The central ground is clear and firmly used. Canvas and earth give the enclosure a close, temporary smell, with ordinary practicality doing the work of decoration.")
mist(41242, "Concrete spans close above the battered parking garage. Old tire arcs overlap faded bay lines, and a protective column wears several layers of chipped paint at bumper height. A broad repair has settled to a slightly different level from the surrounding floor. The enclosure smells faintly of rubber and petroleum, with a low, hard echo beneath the stained overhead spans.")
mist(41243, "A sturdy `wworktable`x gives the workshop a clear center of activity. The surface is replaceable, fixed within an older frame whose corners carry a deeper polish from handling. Narrow storage divisions keep the working edges close without crowding them. The room feels practical and personal at once, preserving the small marks of earlier projects in places an ordinary cleanup cannot quite reach.", 'worktable')
mist(41244, "The private sleeping room puts a narrow `wbed`x against the quietest stretch of wall. A folded coverlet adds a darker band at the foot, while a small, undecorated bedside surface keeps the remaining furniture modest. The wall finish is softer around the headboard than near the floor. The enclosure offers privacy through scale, making a lowered voice feel sufficient for the whole room.", 'bed')
mist(41245, "The sleeping tent slopes close around a simple `wbed`x. Broad seams cross the fabric above it, and a doubled lower skirt keeps the ground-level edges heavier than the canopy. A folded blanket adds a rougher texture to the bedding. The shelter smells of canvas and dry fabric, giving rest the intimate, temporary character of something arranged within reach of the wider world.", 'bed')
mist(41248, "A natural recess forms the cave nest within a broader fold of stone. Finer material has gathered in the protected hollow, while the exposed lip remains rough and uneven. A narrow mineral streak follows the ceiling before vanishing behind the curve. The shelter has an animal-sized practicality enlarged into a room, comfortable only in relation to the harder enclosure surrounding it.")
mist(41249, "The caverns open around a series of rounded stone shoulders. Each one interrupts the next, making the visible space wider than any single clear line through it. Pale deposits have gathered beneath the deeper overhangs, and the floor holds a fan of small broken pieces. The enclosure returns sound from several angles, giving even the nearest rock an uncertain relationship with the depth beyond.")
mist(41250, "The depths reveal their structure reluctantly. A broad rock face occupies the nearer view, but the side edges fall away into a space whose limits are difficult to place. Fine mineral lines cross the stone like a map that has lost the larger landscape. The ground remains readable close at hand. Beyond that small certainty, the enclosure seems to continue without offering a comparable scale.")
mist(41251, "The hidden grove is gathered around a low tangle of roots and close, pale-barked trunks. Fine leaves overlap at shoulder height, screening the farther growth without forming a definite wall. A smooth stone has been almost enclosed by two diverging roots. The place feels secluded through accumulation, each small layer of woodland quietly reducing the reach of the view.")
mist(41253, "Curved wood encloses the knothole around a small `wresting hollow`x. The lower grain is smooth enough to settle against, while the upper surfaces twist into deeper ridges around a dark knot. Fine bark dust has gathered in the sheltered seams. The tree gives the enclosure a warm, dry smell, making the little refuge feel held within something older and more substantial than ordinary walls.", 'resting hollow')
mist(41254, "Deja Brew's barista `wcounter`x has a broad working top and a softly rounded customer edge. Cup-shaped marks survive beneath the wiped finish, while a narrow shelf makes a rhythm of small handles above the service fittings. A faded patch in the decorative backing suggests an earlier arrangement. The coffee smell is comfortably settled, giving the compact room the familiarity of a visit almost remembered.", 'counter')
mist(41255, "A rumpled `wbed`x occupies one side of a room that has allowed a project to spread through the rest. The `wworktable`x carries a crowded working patch surrounded by clearer outlines where things have been moved, and a draped piece of fabric nearly bridges the two halves. The disorder is specific rather than shapeless, the visible negotiation between needing somewhere to sleep and being unwilling to stop making something.", 'bed', 'worktable')

special('hvntown.are',10128,"Chrome curves around Rosie's long `wcounter`x, bright along the customer edge and softly clouded behind the stools. The `wbooths`x sit beneath a row of modest framed prints, their upholstered backs making snug little alcoves. One tabletop keeps a pale circle beneath the finish, a stubborn souvenir of an earlier breakfast. Coffee and old syrup lend the diner the easy warmth of a place people return to without planning a special occasion.",'counter','booths')
special('hvntown.are',15041,"The Lodge's `wbar`x is a dark, substantial sweep of timber beneath a shallow carved border. `wBooths`x gather against the paneled walls, with the nearest upholstery catching a warmer tone than the wood around it. A long mirror returns the counter in a softened second line. Old spirits and polish mingle in the air, giving the room a comfortable weight that suits company lingering over an unfinished story.",'bar','booths')
special('hvntown.are',15042,"The Lodge's `wbilliards tables`x make islands of green felt within the timber-framed recreation room. Pale chalk traces cling to the cushioned rails, and the clear floor preserves the looping wear of people searching for the next angle. A `wwatching bench`x rests beneath a plain section of paneling. The arrangement lets company follow the game closely without crowding the careful movements around the tables.",'billiards tables','watching bench')
special('hvntown.are',15049,"A broad `wshared table`x gives the Lodge dining room a generous center. The wood has a darker, smoother edge where plates and elbows have repeatedly met it, while `wcorner seats`x tuck beneath the quieter wall trim. A narrow decorative band repeats the grain of the heavier furniture. The room offers a sturdy domestic warmth, making a shared meal feel like an ordinary reason to stay a little longer.",'shared table','corner seats')
special('hvntown.are',15050,"The Lodge foyer opens around a clear strip of floor polished by arriving shoes. A substantial `wwaiting bench`x stands beneath timber paneling whose lowest edges show the small knocks of luggage. A framed landscape occupies the wall opposite, broad enough to reward a seated glance. The room has the modest warmth of a place prepared to receive people, with the bench offering a pause before a visit takes shape.",'waiting bench')
special('hvntown.are',1133,"The Arkwright Mausoleum closes around memorial stonework fitted more carefully than the rougher mass enclosing it. Pale traces lie in the deeper joints, and the floor has been kept spare before the named surfaces. One carved border has softened enough to blur the smallest leaves. The cool mineral air lends the little chamber a solemn weight, settled deep in the joints between the carved surfaces.")
special('hvntown.are',18185,"The planetarium gathers `wviewing seats`x beneath a dome that removes the usual straight edges from the upper room. The padded backs angle attention away from the floor, making even the blank overhead curve feel prepared for a larger view. Narrow armrests separate the seats without isolating them. The enclosure has the particular anticipation of a sky waiting to be presented, with company settled comfortably below it.",'viewing seats')
special('goblin.are',405010,"The Fleshforming Clinic has made an exact, washable island inside the Goblin Market's rough construction. A narrow `wtreatment table`x occupies the cleared space, backed by fittings whose clean edges are almost too conspicuous beside the uneven walls. The surrounding joinery refuses to match the clinical surfaces. The contrast gives the room an unsettling precision, as though the care spent preparing it says little about whether the purpose should be comforting.",'treatment table')
special('goblin.are',405011,"The Folly's `wcorner seats`x are a mismatched gathering of patched furniture tucked against an irregular wall. Different wood finishes meet without quite agreeing, and one carefully repaired edge is newer than anything surrounding it. A small tabletop brings the chairs into conversational reach. The room feels rescued rather than furnished, a refuge whose warmth comes from ordinary things being allowed another useful life.",'corner seats')

special('aust.are',39000,"Broad curves lift above the Opera House's `waudience seats`x, drawing the eye away from the close ranks of upholstery toward the height of the hall. Fine wooden ribs make a warmer pattern within the larger shell. The armrests shine more brightly than the backs, polished by waiting hands. Even in the hush, the room seems built around the possibility of one clear note reaching everyone at once.",'audience seats')
special('dream.are',390035,"A narrow `wtreatment table`x occupies a harshly lit pocket between ribbed bulkheads. The washable surface is unnervingly pale beside the darker housings and the deep red-brown traces that survive in their seams. A circular fitting hangs over the working position, turning the table into the center of an ugly little tableau. Metal, disinfectant, and enclosed shipboard air make the room feel meticulously prepared for something no comfort could soften.",'treatment table')
special('dream.are',390725,"Naglfar's captain's cabin keeps a heavy `wdesk`x within the curve of the enclosing hull. The wood is dark along the lower edges, with pale salt worked deep into a seam beneath the nearest fitting. A chart-shaped rectangle has faded into the desktop. The low overhead timbers lend the cabin a burdened quiet, as though each small creak has traveled through more of the vessel than the room can show.",'desk')
special('dream.are',390728,"A broad `wdesk`x is fitted into the captain's cabin aboard Sea's Mercy, the outer lip raised to keep small things from slipping away. A faded blue cloth softens the nearest wall panel, and brass corners hold a steadier shine than the surrounding wood. The quarters have a compact, deliberate neatness. Tar and old polish mingle beneath it, reminders of the working hull wrapped close around this private room.",'desk')
special('dream.are',390731,"The captain's cabin aboard HMS Majestic sets a squared `wdesk`x beneath orderly paneling. A thin decorative line follows the joinery, broken only where a substantial fitting has been replaced with plainer wood. The chair back is high and narrowly padded. Everything has been measured into the confined hull, giving the small quarters a formal authority that reaches beyond their modest span.",'desk')

special('asia.are',39030,"Close screens surround a private `wshower`x, leaving an open rectangle overhead. Pale pebbles are set into the floor around the drain, their rounded tops smoother than the rougher stone at the edges. A simple rail holds a folded towel beneath a projecting cap of wood. The bathroom offers shelter at shoulder height and openness above, with the mineral smell of the washing surface close at hand.",'shower')
special('asia.are',39031,"A narrow `wshower`x stands behind staggered wooden screens, with the sky left open above the enclosure. Fine pale seams divide the darker paving, leading toward a shallow drainage channel along one side. A recessed shelf keeps a small soap dish clear of the floor. The private washing space is spare and tactile, all cool stone, close-grained wood, and a little softness in the folded linen.",'shower')
special('asia.are',39032,"A curved screen gives the open-air bathroom a sheltered inner face. The `wshower`x is backed by small cream tiles, several of them subtly warmer than the surrounding glaze. Coarser stone borders the drain, and a short towel rail fits into the curve beside it. The upper edges frame the open sky, keeping the little washing enclosure connected to the air above the private fittings.",'shower')
special('hvntown.are',2467,"Mildew darkens the grout behind the apartment's `wshower`x, retreating only where a recent wipe has left a pale, uneven stripe. The mirror has a cloudy lower edge, and the soap dish keeps an old amber stain beneath the cleanest part of the glaze. A tired towel hangs crookedly from the rail. The room smells of damp fabric and a stubborn trace of cleaning fluid, two histories that have never quite canceled each other out.",'shower')
special('hvntown.are',3015,"The `wshower`x fits within a clean-lined recess of pale stone and carefully aligned glass. A narrow band of brushed metal conceals the joins around the fittings, while the drain follows a straight, almost invisible seam along the floor. The mirror returns a broad, uninterrupted reflection. The bathroom feels precise and quietly luxurious, with the soft fold of a towel providing the only relaxed edge among the measured surfaces.",'shower')
special('hvntown.are',10842,"The Retreat's outdoor `wshower`x rises from a slatted platform, with fine sand caught safely below the gaps. A weather-softened screen shelters the fittings on one side, leaving the upper air open. Pale mineral traces curve beneath the nozzle, and the wood nearest the drain has darkened to a richer brown. The washing place keeps the beach close in the grain, even where the surface has been rinsed clear.",'shower')
special('hvntown.are',10863,"A simple `wshower`x occupies a screened corner of the Retreat's outdoor washing platform. Broad wooden slats lead toward a gravel-filled drainage strip, their smooth upper faces divided by dark, sandy seams. A little hook is fixed beneath the screen's projecting cap. The open air and weathered wood give the fittings an easy seaside practicality, with no grander promise than somewhere to rinse away the shore.",'shower')
